  "semantics": [
    "Group-32 dynamic E4M3 activation casts clamp amax at 1e-4 and round scales upward to powers of two",
    "F32 weighted SwiGLU output is cast directly; no intermediate BF16 cast",
    "Raw checkpoint scale byte 0 means OCP 2^-127; live packed zero/padding is rejected",
    "Quantized linear requires packed FP8 activation input and explicit FP8-block32 or MXFP4 weights",
    "Expert composes BF16 gate/up outputs, F32 weighted SwiGLU, FP8 down input and BF16 output",
    "Control matmul expands only an output tile on its bound device; it is not an SM90 low-precision tensor-core kernel"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Unfused expanded F32 control refuses decoded overflow even when a factorized hardware kernel could support the raw packed operands",
    "Tiny width-32 fixtures exercise group-32 math; the pinned CUDA per-token frontend requires hidden width divisible by 64",
    "No CUDA compile, GPU execution, full model/layer routing, aggregate model HBM or performance proof"
  ],
